import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const d=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 611 | Time-Domain Technical Implementation | Quest-Domain Consciousness-Immersion Technology","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 611 | Time-Domain Technical Implementation | Quest-Domain Consciousness-Immersion Technology","no":611,"module":3,"tags":["Quest Sediment Domain","Consciousness Immersion","Experience Preservation","Technical Implementation","Trial"],"related":["12-Life-Cycle System Details","21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principle","29-Symbiosis-Degree Assessment System"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0611_模块3-时间域技术实现-求索域意识沉浸技术.md","filePath":"en/0611_模块3-时间域技术实现-求索域意识沉浸技术.md"}'),s={name:"en/0611_模块3-时间域技术实现-求索域意识沉浸技术.md"};function a(r,e,l,c,m,u){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-611-time-domain-technical-implementation-quest-domain-consciousness-immersion-technology" tabindex="-1">Entry 611 | Time-Domain Technical Implementation | Quest-Domain Consciousness-Immersion Technology <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-611-time-domain-technical-implementation-quest-domain-consciousness-immersion-technology" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 611 | Time-Domain Technical Implementation | Quest-Domain Consciousness-Immersion Technology&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Documents 12, 21, 29 | Series: Time-Domain Technical Implementation (Entry 3)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-let-consciousness-truly-live-through-it-not-just-watch-it" tabindex="-1">Introduction: let consciousness truly &quot;live&quot; through it, not just &quot;watch&quot; it <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-let-consciousness-truly-live-through-it-not-just-watch-it" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: let consciousness truly &quot;live&quot; through it, not just &quot;watch&quot; it&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Origin Acceleration Domain&#39;s technical difficulty is &quot;boundary&quot;; the Quest Sediment Domain&#39;s technical difficulty is &quot;immersion.&quot; The Quest Domain&#39;s core is slow trials, deep experience — but if the entrant always knows &quot;this is just simulation,&quot; experience sense is discounted, and epics and insights cannot sediment. So technology must solve a contradiction: <strong>let consciousness sufficiently invest, gaining real trial thickness; yet not let consciousness completely lose itself, mistaking simulation for reality and unable to return</strong>. This is consciousness-immersion technology. This entry tells how the Quest Domain turns &quot;immersive trials&quot; into controllable engineering.</p><p>Six top-level axioms are the immersion technology&#39;s criterion: anti-predation axiom requires immersive trials not swallow participants&#39; real life; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires immersion open to Myriad Ranks with safety nets; collective ascension axiom requires insights produced by immersion feed back to the whole network; causal self-discipline axiom requires immersion not produce real causal pollution; law-first axiom requires immersion depth, exit mechanism, experience preservation all have law definitions. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-three-technical-layers-of-immersion" tabindex="-1">I. Three Technical Layers of Immersion <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-three-technical-layers-of-immersion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Three Technical Layers of Immersion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Quest Domain&#39;s immersion is not &quot;making a dream,&quot; but a progressive three-layer:</p><ol><li><strong>Perception-layer immersion</strong>: first let participants&#39; five senses (or equivalent perceptual channels) connect with the simulated environment, gaining &quot;being there&quot; physical realism.</li><li><strong>Emotion-layer immersion</strong>: on top of perceptual realism, evoke situation-matched emotional responses, making trials no longer &quot;watching a video,&quot; but &quot;truly moved.&quot;</li><li><strong>Identity-layer immersion</strong>: deepest layer, let participants temporarily &quot;become&quot; the role in the trial, bear its responsibilities and choices, gaining personality-thickness tempering.</li></ol><p>The deeper the layer, the more real the experience, but the greater the loss-risk. Engineering-wise, layers are self-selected by participants, with an &quot;exit anchor&quot; throughout.</p><h2 id="ii-exit-anchor-preventing-immersion-from-becoming-addiction" tabindex="-1">II. Exit Anchor: Preventing Immersion from Becoming Addiction <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-exit-anchor-preventing-immersion-from-becoming-addiction" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Exit Anchor: Preventing Immersion from Becoming Addiction&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Consciousness-immersion technology&#39;s safety core is the <strong>exit anchor</strong> — a consciousness node always clear, not blurring as immersion deepens. Its role:</p><ul><li><strong>Exitable anytime</strong>: participants at any layer, by the exit anchor may withdraw anytime, not &quot;locked&quot; inside by simulation. This forms a fundamental contrast with the Main God Space (Entry 607)&#39;s forced prison.</li><li><strong>Reality anchoring</strong>: the exit anchor always connects to the participant&#39;s real-plane vital signs; once body-mind over-limit, automatically awakened.</li><li><strong>Memory isolation</strong>: high-intensity emotions in immersion are not permanently written into real personality; after exit smooth transition, avoiding trial trauma becoming real mental illness.</li></ul><p>Exit right is sacred and non-deprivable; this is the Quest Domain&#39;s dividing line from all &quot;spiritual prisons.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-experience-preservation-indicators" tabindex="-1">III. Experience-Preservation Indicators <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-experience-preservation-indicators" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Experience-Preservation Indicators&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Immersion technology has a must-quantify goal — <strong>experience-preservation degree</strong>. It answers Entry 501&#39;s core proposition &quot;acceleration ≠ emptiness&quot;: after staying in the slow domain for the set duration, did the participant truly gain sediment-able insight, or just had a vague dream?</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Preservation Dimension</th><th>Measurement Method</th><th>Pass Line</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Memory Clarity</td><td>After exit, retell key trial nodes</td><td>Key plot points no major omission</td></tr><tr><td>Emotional Authenticity</td><td>Empathy assessment (Document 29)</td><td>≥80% of real-life equivalent events</td></tr><tr><td>Insight Conversion</td><td>Whether producible abstract lessons feed back</td><td>At least one archivable debrief</td></tr><tr><td>Personality Stability</td><td>Post-exit emotional, cognitive baseline</td><td>No significant drift</td></tr></tbody></table><p>All four pass, this immersion &quot;worth it&quot;; any one failing, technically counted as experience failure, need to adjust immersion parameters and redo.</p><h2 id="iv-myriad-rank-consciousness-adaptation" tabindex="-1">IV. Myriad-Rank Consciousness Adaptation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-myriad-rank-consciousness-adaptation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Myriad-Rank Consciousness Adaptation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Consciousness-immersion technology&#39;s greatest engineering complexity comes from the diversity of Myriad-Rank consciousness forms:</p><ul><li><strong>Carbon-based human race</strong>: immerse through five senses + emotional channels, exit anchor set at self-consciousness core.</li><li><strong>Consciousness-information race</strong>: itself a consciousness body, immersion method is &quot;access&quot; not &quot;injection,&quot; exit anchor set at its native rhythm.</li><li><strong>Plant spirits, planet consciousness</strong>: time units and perception modes completely different, must first do time-unit conversion (Entry 504), then design adapted immersion channels.</li><li><strong>Mechanical-construction race</strong>: emotional channels need simulation, focus is &quot;choice immersion&quot; not &quot;emotion immersion.&quot;</li></ul><p>Myriad-Rank Republicanism requires: <strong>immersion technology may not default &quot;human-style consciousness&quot; as the only standard</strong>; each lineage must have its own immersion solution.</p><h2 id="brief-transition" tabindex="-1">Brief Transition <a class="header-anchor" href="#brief-transition" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Brief Transition&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Immersion technology&#39;s all records — entry, exit, experience assessment — flow into the Alaya Network, retrieved and audited by multi-layer supervision. This means every safe trial in the Quest Sediment Domain becomes network-wide queryable public experience, not sealed in personal memory.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: immersion parameters optimized for target trials, no ineffective &quot;high immersion low output&quot;; experience-preservation degree backstops</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: immersive trials do not swallow participants&#39; real life; exit right and memory isolation prevent &quot;gone forever&quot;</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s trials rely on &quot;protagonist naturally strong mind&quot; forcing it; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s immersion relies on engineering-guaranteed experience, the weak may also safely trial</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: five lineages each have adapted immersion channels; plant spirits, planet consciousness not excluded from epics</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: immersion protocols, exit mechanisms, preservation standards public; newly merged planes&#39; consciousness forms may adapt by interface</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Quest Sediment Domain wants not &quot;false dreams,&quot; but &quot;real thickness.&quot; Consciousness-immersion technology walks a tightrope between &quot;real enough to move&quot; and &quot;clear enough to exit&quot; — relying on perception/emotion/identity three progressive layers, exit-anchor backstop, experience-preservation acceptance. When a person can safely, deeply &quot;live through&quot; a life never lived, and return with real insight, the Quest Domain truly becomes the epic cradle.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/12-生命循环体系详解.html">Entry 12 · Life-Cycle System Details</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/21-共生网络运作原理.html">Entry 21 · Symbiotic Network Operating Principle</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/29-共生度评估体系.html">Entry 29 · Symbiosis-Degree Assessment System</a> · <a href="./501_模块3-双轨时间域总论.html">Entry 501 · Dual-Track Time Domain Overview</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const p=i(s,[["render",a]]);export{d as __pageData,p as default};
